# CaiRobot MVP .gitignore

## IDE / Editor
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

## OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

## Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.venv/
venv/

## Node.js
node_modules/
dist/
.next/

## Go
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
*.prof
vendor/
bin/

## Tabbit / TRAE 原始导出收件箱（inbox 不入库，保留 README 和目录结构）
#docs/tabbit/inbox/**/*
#docs/trae-export/inbox/**/*
!docs/tabbit/inbox/**/.gitkeep
!docs/trae-export/inbox/**/.gitkeep

## TRAE 原始执行/归档文件
*.exec.md
*.raw.md

## 测试覆盖率报告（生成产物，不入库）
docs/reports/coverage/

## 临时文件
tmp/
docs/drafts/

## Admin MVP 运行时（PID + 日志，不入库）
.admin-pids/
.admin-logs/
go/admin/go-admin-db.db
go/gateway/proto-gateway/cmd/server/__debug_bin1360420036
